{"id": "20569602", "revid": "1306622105", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20569602", "title": "Gunnar \u00c5kerlund", "text": "Ernst Gunnar \u00c5kerlund (20 November 1923 \u2013 4 October 2006) was a Swedish canoe sprinter who competed in the late 1940s and early 1950s. He won two Olympic medals in the K-2 10000 m event: a gold in 1948 and a silver in 1952.\n\u00c5kerlund won three medals at the ICF Canoe Sprint World Championships with two golds (K-2 10000 m: 1950, K-4 1000 m: 1948) and a silver (K-4 1000 m: 1950)."}
